<title>POLAND: ELPO TO ENTER PARALLEL MARKET JUNE 25.</title>
<headline>ELPO TO ENTER PARALLEL MARKET JUNE 25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Elpo SA will move to the bourse's parallel market from the free market of even smaller less-liquid stocks on June 25, bourse deputy head Wlodzimierz Magiera told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
